 4)；Prometheus 指标确认了容器以 Error 状态终止并进入重启循环 (证据 1, 2)。\n*   **现象解释**：Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 且 RestartCount 为 12，是因为 K8s 检测到主进程 (PID 1) 异常退出后尝试重启，但应用逻辑导致其再次触发退出，最终因重启间隔超过退避上限而锁定状态。\n*   **未确认事项**：无法从当前数据确定 500 错误的具体业务逻辑原因，也无法判断该“执行后即退出”的行为是否符合单任务处理模式的业务预期。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.5m\n├─ 问题定位: 23.5s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 175.9s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b: 175.9s (Evidence 166.2s, RCA 9.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 13.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-jwr8b**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 212.574, "metrics": {"run_id": "87189fed09d3452d", "mttr": {"value": "3.5m", "seconds": 212.58171558380127, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "48%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "完整因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 5